<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN WORLD CUP QUALIFIERS COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN WORLD CUP QUALIFIERS COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
